        "text": "According to Alfredo Parrish, petitioner Jason Pepper, after completing drug treatment in prison and succeeding as a college student, employee, and family man, presents two questions to the Court: (1) whether post\u2011sentencing rehabilitation can justify a downward variance from the sentencing guidelines at resentencing, and (2) whether the district court is bound by the law\u2011of\u2011the\u2011case doctrine in its 5K departure ruling absent new facts, changes in the controlling law, or to avoid a manifest injustice."
